pyrrolidone) ({NAEP}) leads to in situ molecular dissolution of the {PHBA} latex, with subsequent {RAFT} polymerization leading to the formation of sterically stabilized {PHBA}–{PNAEP} diblock copolymer nanoparticles of approximately 57 nm diameter. Such formulations constitute a new approach to reverse sequence polymerization-induced self-assembly, whereby the hydrophobic block is prepared first in aqueous media.},
